_audit_update_record
;
2023-10-30 deposited with the CCDC.	2026-10-01 downloaded from the CCDC.
;
_vrf_THETM01_moc_68_cl_p6422
;
PROBLEM: The value of sine(theta_max)/wavelength is less than 0.550
RESPONSE:  Although we have used Cu radiation, long exposure time,
and best crystal obtained to collect the best data set. The crystals immediately
lost solvent after removal from the mother liquor. The weak diffraction makes
the reflection in the high angle not complete.
;
_vrf_RINTA01_moc_68_cl_p6422
;
PROBLEM: The value of Rint is greater than 0.18
RESPONSE: This alert may originate from the poor data of the single-crystal.
;
_vrf_PLAT020_moc_68_cl_p6422
;
PROBLEM: The Value of Rint is Greater Than 0.12 .........      0.199 Report
RESPONSE: This alert may originate from the poor data of the single-crystal.
;
_vrf_PLAT342_moc_68_cl_p6422
;
PROBLEM: Low Bond Precision on  C-C Bonds ...............    0.03122 Ang.  
RESPONSE:  It is due to poor quality of x-ray data.
;
_vrf_PLAT987_moc_68_cl_p6422
;
PROBLEM: The Flack x is >> 0 -  Do a BASF/TWIN Refinement     Please Check 
